<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>’Tis done—the great transaction’s done;</l><l>I am my Lord’s, and He is mine;</l><l>He drew me and I followed on,</l><l>Rejoiced to own the call divine.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Now rest, my long-divided heart,</l><l>Fixed on this blissful center, rest;</l><l>Here have I found a nobler part,</l><l>Here heav’nly pleasures fill my breast.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>High heav’n that hears the solemn vow,</l><l>That vow renewed shall daily hear!</l><l>Till in life’s latest hour I bow,</l><l>And bless, in death, a bond so dear.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
